From: Lorenzo Stoakes <lorenzo.stoakes@oracle.com>
Subject: mm: replace remaining pte_to_swp_entry() with leafent_from_pte()
Date: Mon, 3 Nov 2025 12:31:57 +0000

There are straggler invocations of pte_to_swp_entry() lying around,
replace all of these with the leaf entry equivalent - leafent_from_pte().

With those removed, eliminate pte_to_swp_entry() altogether.

No functional change intended.

Link: https://lkml.kernel.org/r/1518bb0d0e40ace2012e64590288046aef03781e.1762171281.git.lorenzo.stoakes@oracle.com
